          "text": "Témoignages: [AERO TVF] de AMMAN (JO.AM) vers ORLY (94) 31.01.2023",
          "text_sha256": "d3e2de58829472bd7d28323e87a0494a71c01c0bcd74113226bfc725a23797db"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
